# Force LF line endings in the repo so working trees on Windows and CI stay
# byte-identical. Prevents an entire-tree "modified" false positive caused by
# CRLF conversion (git diff -w shows zero content changes).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
